  Forceful Blow. The target is pushed 15 feet straight away from you. You can then move up to half your Speed straight toward the target without provoking Opportunity Attacks.
  Hamstring Blow. The target''s Speed is reduced by 15 feet until the start of your next turn. A target can be affected by only one Hamstring Blow at a time- the most recent one.', 1)
